{title: 519 - Give to the Winds Your Fears}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Eb/Bb]Give [Gm]to the winds [Gbm]your fears;
[Gm/D]In [Bb]hope be undismayed:
[Bb]God [Adim]hears [Bb]your [Dm]sighs [Eb/Bb]and [Dm/A]coundts [Eb/G]your tears,
[Dm/F]God [Gm/D]shall [Cm/G]lift [Bb]up [F/C]your [Eb/Bb]head.

Verse 2:
[Eb/Bb]To [Gm]Him commit [Gbm]your griefs;
[Gm/D]Your [Bb]ways put in [Adim]His hands
[Bb]To [Adim]His [Bb]sure [Dm]truth [Eb/Bb]adn [Dm/A]tender [Eb/G]care
[Dm/F]Who [Gm/D]earth [Cm/G]adn [Bb]heave [F/C]commands.

Verse 3:
[Eb/Bb]O [Gm]put your trust [Gbm]in God;
[Gm/D]In [Bb]duty's path [Adim]go on.
[Bb]Walk [Adim]in [Bb]His [Dm]strength [Eb/Bb]with [Dm/A]faith [Eb/G]and hope,
[Dm/F]So [Gm/D]shall [Cm/G]your [Bb]work [F/C]be [Eb/Bb]done.

Verse 4:
[Eb/Bb]Leave [Gm]to His sovereign [Gbm]sway
[Gm/D]To [Bb]choose and to [Adim]command;
[Bb]So [Adim]you [Bb]shall, [Dm]faithful, seek [Eb/G]His way
[Dm/F]how [Gm/D]wise, [Cm/G]how [Bb]strong [F/C]His [Eb/Bb]hand!
